      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "card-light",
      "description": "Lightly separated project information.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-summary\"><h2>Awareness</h2><p>Triển lãm trực tuyến về nhận thức.</p><dl><div><dt>Nền tảng</dt><dd>Web</dd></div><div><dt>Triển khai</dt><dd>Vercel</dd></div></dl></section>",
      "css": ".ds-summary{padding:28px;border:1px solid var(--line,#DCD5C9);border-radius:16px;color:var(--ink,#23201D);background:var(--card,#EAE4DA);font:400 1rem/1.55 Aptos,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}.ds-summary h2{margin:0 0 12px;font:600 1.75rem/1.1 \"Source Serif 4\",Georgia,serif}.ds-summary p,.ds-summary dt{color:var(--muted,#6E675F)}.ds-summary dl{margin:24px 0 0}.ds-summary dl div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line,#DCD5C9)}.ds-summary dd{margin:0;font-weight:700}"
